

**6. Gamma Function and Related Functions**

**Mathematical Properties**

**6.1. Gamma (Factorial) Function**

**Euler's Integral**

**6.1.1**: \(\Gamma(z)\!=\!\int_{0}^{\infty}\!t^{-\!1}e^{-t}dt\)__\(({\mathscr{R}}z\!>\!\!0)\)__

**6.1.2**: \(\Gamma(z)\!=\!\lim_{n\to n}\frac{n!n^{\prime}}{z(z\!+\!1)\ldots(z\!+\!n)}\)__\((z\!\neq\!\!0,\!-\!1,\!-\!2,\ldots)\)__

**Euler's Infinite Product**

**6.1.3**: \(\frac{1}{\Gamma(z)}\!=\!ze^{\alpha\!n}\!\!